      "description": "Adjunct, Accounting and International Business - Houston, Texas, United States Adjunct, Accounting and International Business - Houston, Texas, United States Kiosk mode Adjunct, Accounting and International Business 495595 Part-Time Accounting & Int'l Business Department : Accounting & Int'l Business Salary : University of Houston-Downtown Marilyn Davies College of Business Description : Job Description: The Accounting and International Business department of the Marilyn Davies College of Business at the University of Houston-Downtown (UHD) is seeking applicants for Adjunct positions in accounting. The successful candidate will teach undergraduate courses in accounting, have a demonstrated potential for instructional excellence, and maintain his or her credentials. Official transcripts will be required from candidates considered for hire. Qualifications: Candidates for this position must hold a Master’s degree in Accountancy or an MBA with a concentration in Accountancy and currently be employed as an accountant. Candidates with a Ph.D. or DBA degree in Accountancy from an AACSB accredited business school and industry experience in the area of accounting are strongly preferred. Required Attachments by Candidate Curriculum Vitae, Cover Letter/Letter of Application All positions at the University of Houston-System are security sensitive and will require a criminal history check. The University of Houston System and its universities are Equal Opportunity Institutions. Everyone is encouraged to apply. Apply now First Name (required) 63d7e38f Last Name (required) a1b728fe Email (required) fffad824 Cell number 41d1e153 244 results found No results found Afghanistan (+93) Åland Islands (+358) Albania (+355) Algeria (+213) American Samoa (+1) Andorra (+376) Angola (+244) Anguilla (+1) Antigua & Barbuda (+1) Argentina (+54) Armenia (+374) Aruba (+297) Ascension Island (+247) Australia (+61) Austria (+43) Azerbaijan (+994) Bahamas (+1) Bahrain (+973) Ban