      "description": "Adjunct, Finance - Houston, Texas, United States Adjunct, Finance - Houston, Texas, United States Kiosk mode Adjunct, Finance 495632 Part-Time Fin, Inf Sys, Econ & Risk Mgmt Department : Fin, Inf Sys, Econ & Risk Mgmt Salary : Description : The Finance, Information Systems, Economics and Risk Management department of the Marilyn Davies College of Business at the University of Houston-Downtown (UHD) is seeking applicants for Adjunct positions in Finance. All areas in Finance will be considered. The successful candidate will teach undergraduate courses in Finance, have a demonstrated potential for instructional excellence, and maintain his or her credentials. Qualifications: Candidates for this position must hold, at minimum, a master’s degree or MBA in Finance or a related area and be currently employed in a finance position. Preferred Qualifications: Candidates with a Ph.D. or DBA degree in Finance or a related area from an AACSB accredited business school and industry experience in the area of Finance are strongly preferred. Required Attachments by Candidate: Official transcripts will be required from candidates considered for hire. Curriculum Vitae, Cover Letter/Letter of Application, Letters of Recommendation, Unofficial Transcripts All positions at the University of Houston-System are security sensitive and will require a criminal history check. The University of Houston System and its universities are Equal Opportunity Institutions. Everyone is encouraged to apply. Apply now First Name (required) 5db43f0d Last Name (required) 8f5aa685 Email (required) 61ee6bb3 Cell number 5962cd18 244 results found No results found Afghanistan (+93) Åland Islands (+358) Albania (+355) Algeria (+213) American Samoa (+1) Andorra (+376) Angola (+244) Anguilla (+1) Antigua & Barbuda (+1) Argentina (+54) Armenia (+374) Aruba (+297) Ascension Island (+247) Australia (+61) Austria (+43) Azerbaijan (+994) Bahamas (+1) Bahrain (+973) Bangladesh (+880) Barbados (+1)