      "description": "Adjunct, Management - Houston, Texas, United States Adjunct, Management - Houston, Texas, United States Kiosk mode Adjunct, Management 495175 Part-Time Management Department: Management Salary: Commensurate with Experience/Education Description: The Department of Management of the Marilyn Davies College of Business at the University of Houston-Downtown (UHD) seeks applicants to teach as adjunct faculty. The successful candidate will have a demonstrated record or potential for instructional excellence and maintain his or her professional credentials. Specifically, we are seeking individuals with research and/or professional qualifications to teach any of the following: Principles of Management Operations Management Problem Solving and Decision Making Human Resource Management Compensation and Benefits Staffing Training and Development Leadership Organizational Behavior Business Strategy Qualifications Master’s degree in teaching discipline or closely related field Preferred Qualifications Ph.D. in teaching discipline or closely related field Academic publications in peer-reviewed journals within the last 5 years Significant industry or consulting experience within the last 5 years Teaching or corporate training experience Minimum five years of progressive industry experience aligned or closely related to the teaching discipline All positions at the University of Houston-System are security sensitive and will require a criminal history check. The University of Houston System and its universities are Equal Opportunity Institutions. Everyone is encouraged to apply. Apply now First Name (required) 0715934d Last Name (required) 46518266 Email (required) 31ce631a Cell number 972e8589 244 results found No results found Afghanistan (+93) Åland Islands (+358) Albania (+355) Algeria (+213) American Samoa (+1) Andorra (+376) Angola (+244) Anguilla (+1) Antigua & Barbuda (+1) Argentina (+54) Armenia (+374) Aruba (+297) Ascension Island (+247) Australia (+61